---
import type { Locale } from '../i18n';
import { aiGalaxySeedSnapshot as market } from '../data/aiGalaxySeedSnapshot';

interface Props { locale: Locale }
const { locale } = Astro.props;
const isZh = locale === 'zh';
const t = (zh: string, en: string) => isZh ? zh : en;

const hourly4090 = market.hourly.find((item) => item.gpu === 'RTX 4090 24G')?.cnyPerHour ?? 1.65;
const hourlyA100 = market.hourly.find((item) => item.gpu === 'NVIDIA A100 80G')?.cnyPerHour ?? 8;
const cloudPrepLow = 4 * hourly4090 + 10 * hourlyA100;
const cloudPrepHigh = 8 * hourly4090 + 18 * hourlyA100;
const money = (value: number) => `¥${value.toFixed(1)}`;
---

<section id="seed-owned-3090" class="owned-compute" aria-labelledby="seed-owned-3090-title">
  <header class="owned-head">
    <div>
      <span class="section-kicker">{t('已有算力时的省钱路线', 'Cost-saving path when you already have compute')}</span>
      <h2 id="seed-owned-3090-title">{t('如果已经能用 4×RTX 3090 24GB：先把能免费的阶段全部做完', 'If you can already use 4×RTX 3090 24GB: finish every stage you can before renting')}</h2>
      <p>{t('这不是把 4×3090 宣称成论文的 8×A800，也不是假设四张卡等于一张 96GB GPU。它的价值是把环境、数据、SFT、缩小 RL 和真机 profiling 从付费算力上搬走，再决定是否值得购买论文规模的云端时间。', 'This does not turn 4×3090 into the paper’s 8×A800, and four cards are not one pooled 96GB GPU. Their value is to move environment setup, data work, SFT, reduced RL, and real profiling off paid compute before deciding whether paper-scale cloud time is worth buying.')}</p>
    </div>
    <aside>
      <strong>{t('硬件事实', 'Hardware fact')}</strong>
      <p>{t('RTX 3090 是 Ampere，单卡 24GB GDDR6X。NVIDIA 的 30 系 NVLink Bridge 官方描述是连接两张卡，因此 4 卡机器不能直接假设拥有 A100/A800 八卡节点那样的统一高速互联；实际 PCIe / P2P / NVLink 拓扑要上机检查。', 'RTX 3090 is Ampere with 24GB GDDR6X per GPU. NVIDIA describes the 30-series NVLink Bridge as linking two cards, so a four-GPU host must not be assumed to have the unified high-speed fabric of an 8×A100/A800 node; inspect its actual PCIe / P2P / NVLink topology.')}</p>
      <a href="https://www.nvidia.com/en-us/geforce/graphics-cards/30-series/rtx-3090-3090ti/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">{t('NVIDIA 官方规格', 'NVIDIA official specs')} ↗</a>
    </aside>
  </header>

  <div class="owned-grid">
    <article class="owned-card recommended">
      <small>{t('最推荐：先做这些', 'Recommended first')}</small>
      <h3>{t('环境 + SFT + 缩小 RL + 5-update profiling', 'Environment + SFT + reduced RL + 5-update profiling')}</h3>
      <div class="metric">{t('首次排期：12–24 小时', 'Initial schedule: 12–24 hours')}</div>
      <div class="price">{t('平台租金增量：¥0', 'Incremental platform rental: ¥0')}</div>
      <p>{t('推算不是“3090 实测速度”：当前云上 A 档环境准备预算是 4–8h，B 档缩小训练是 10–18h，串行共 14–26h。4 张卡可以并行一部分计算，但 24GB/卡可能增加切分、offload、通信和首次配置成本，所以不直接按 4 倍加速，而把第一次完整准备窗口收敛为 12–24h。真正跑起来以后仍用 5 个稳定 update 的中位数替换这个区间。', 'This is not a measured 3090 benchmark. The current cloud budgets are 4–8h for environment bring-up and 10–18h for the reduced training check, or 14–26h serially. Four GPUs can parallelize part of the work, but 24GB per GPU can add sharding, offload, communication, and first-time setup overhead. Instead of assuming 4× speedup, use a 12–24h first-pass window and replace it with the median of five stable updates once the run is live.')}</p>
      <div class="claim">{t('目的：把所有“可能因为环境/代码失败而浪费的钱”先消灭。', 'Purpose: eliminate the paid time most likely to be wasted on environment or code failures.')}</div>
    </article>

    <article class="owned-card savings">
      <small>{t('直接能省下多少云租金', 'Direct cloud rental avoided')}</small>
      <h3>{t('至少先省掉 A + B 两档', 'At minimum, replace cloud tiers A + B')}</h3>
      <div class="metric">{money(cloudPrepLow)}–{money(cloudPrepHigh)}</div>
      <div class="price">{t('按当前智星云公开价计算', 'Using the current AI Galaxy public prices')}</div>
      <p>{t(`4090 smoke test：4–8h × ¥${hourly4090.toFixed(2)}/h = ¥${(4 * hourly4090).toFixed(1)}–${(8 * hourly4090).toFixed(1)}；单卡 A100 缩小训练：10–18h × ¥${hourlyA100.toFixed(1)}/h = ¥${(10 * hourlyA100).toFixed(0)}–${(18 * hourlyA100).toFixed(0)}。合计约 ${money(cloudPrepLow)}–${money(cloudPrepHigh)}。这里只算“没有付给算力平台的钱”，不把本地电费、折旧或排队时间伪装成 ¥0 成本。`, `4090 smoke test: 4–8h × ¥${hourly4090.toFixed(2)}/h = ¥${(4 * hourly4090).toFixed(1)}–${(8 * hourly4090).toFixed(1)}; reduced single-A100 training: 10–18h × ¥${hourlyA100.toFixed(1)}/h = ¥${(10 * hourlyA100).toFixed(0)}–${(18 * hourlyA100).toFixed(0)}. Total avoided platform rental is about ${money(cloudPrepLow)}–${money(cloudPrepHigh)}. This only counts money not paid to the compute platform; it does not pretend electricity, depreciation, or queue time are literally free.`)}</p>
    </article>

    <article class="owned-card">
      <small>{t('如果想完整跑 150 updates', 'If you want all 150 updates locally')}</small>
      <h3>4×RTX 3090 24GB</h3>
      <div class="metric">{t('极粗排期：72–144 小时 / 两环境', 'Very rough schedule: 72–144 hours / both environments')}</div>
      <div class="price">{t('用于安排可用窗口，不是性能保证', 'For availability planning, not a performance guarantee')}</div>
      <p>{t('这个区间只做一阶预算：以 8×A100 当前 32–60h 的两环境预算为锚，卡数减半先近似乘 2 → 64–120h；再为 24GB/卡、PCIe/P2P 拓扑、额外切分/offload 留约 10–20% 不确定性，得到约 70–144h，取整为 72–144h。实际值可能落在区间外，所以前 5 个稳定 update 一出来就应该废弃这个估算。', 'This is only a first-order planning model: start from the current 32–60h budget for both environments on 8×A100, approximately double for half the GPU count → 64–120h, then allow roughly 10–20% uncertainty for 24GB/GPU, PCIe/P2P topology, and extra sharding/offload, giving about 70–144h and rounded to 72–144h. Reality can fall outside this range, so discard this estimate as soon as five stable updates are measured.')}</p>
      <div class="claim">{t('即使完整跑完，也只能作为消费级四卡上的工程/方法重跑，不是论文硬件复现。', 'Even a complete run is an engineering/method rerun on a four-consumer-GPU host, not a paper-hardware reproduction.')}</div>
    </article>

    <article class="owned-card rent-last">
      <small>{t('什么时候才值得真的租 8×A100', 'When 8×A100 is actually worth renting')}</small>
      <h3>{t('只把昂贵节点留给论文规模实验', 'Reserve the expensive node for paper-scale work only')}</h3>
      <div class="metric">¥30,000/{t('月', 'month')}</div>
      <div class="price">{t('当前智星云公开 A100 80G NVLINK×8 裸金属标价', 'Current public AI Galaxy 8×A100 80G NVLINK bare-metal price')}</div>
      <ol>
        <li>{t('先在已有 4×3090 上把 ALFWorld / WebShop、模型、依赖、数据、analyzer API 全部跑稳。', 'Stabilize ALFWorld / WebShop, model, dependencies, data, and analyzer API on the existing 4×3090 first.')}</li>
        <li>{t('至少完成一次 SFT + 缩小 RL，并保存 5 个稳定 update 的时间与显存峰值。', 'Complete at least one SFT + reduced-RL pass and record five stable update times plus peak VRAM.')}</li>
        <li>{t('冻结 repo commit、依赖、数据和启动参数；确认问题不是代码问题后再租八卡。', 'Freeze repo commit, dependencies, data, and launch arguments; rent eight GPUs only after code/environment failure is no longer the main risk.')}</li>
        <li>{t('月租一旦开始，让第一小时做训练/正式 profiling，而不是下载和修环境。', 'Once monthly billing begins, spend the first hour on training/formal profiling—not downloads and environment repair.')}</li>
      </ol>
      <p class="billing">{t('因为当前公开八卡 A100 是月租，提前省掉 10 或 20 小时通常不会把发票从 ¥30,000 直接减掉；真正的收益是一个月里能容纳更多完整尝试，并显著降低“花整月价格买调试时间”的风险。', 'Because the current public 8×A100 product is monthly, saving 10 or 20 hours beforehand does not normally reduce a ¥30,000 monthly invoice directly. The gain is fitting more complete attempts into the month and sharply reducing the risk of paying a full month for debugging time.')}</p>
    </article>
  </div>

  <aside class="decision-line">
    <strong>{t('省钱决策线', 'Cost-minimizing decision line')}</strong>
    <p>{t('4×3090 先跑 12–24h → 方法链不稳就继续免费修 → 如果方法验证已经回答研究问题，平台支出可以停在 ¥0 → 只有确实需要论文规模结果时，才进入 ¥30,000/月的 A100×8。严格硬件复现仍然要另找 8×A800 80G。', 'Run 4×3090 for 12–24h first → if the method chain is unstable, keep debugging off-platform → if method validation already answers the research question, platform spend can remain ¥0 → only buy the ¥30,000/month 8×A100 tier when paper-scale results are actually needed. Exact hardware reproduction still requires sourcing 8×A800 80G separately.')}</p>
  </aside>

  <p class="evidence-note">{t('证据边界：3090 的 24GB/Ampere/NVLink 支持来自 NVIDIA 官方规格；12–24h、72–144h 和省钱顺序是本站的工程规划，不是 SEED 作者实测，也不是对任何具体四卡主机的性能保证。四卡机器的实际 P2P/NVLink/PCIe、CPU、存储、驱动和散热都会改变结果。', 'Evidence boundary: the 3090’s 24GB/Ampere/NVLink support comes from NVIDIA’s official specifications. The 12–24h and 72–144h ranges and the cost-minimizing order are this site’s engineering planning guidance—not measured SEED runtimes or a performance guarantee for any particular four-GPU host. Actual P2P/NVLink/PCIe topology, CPU, storage, drivers, and thermals can change the result.')}</p>
</section>

<style>
  .owned-compute { margin: 0 0 70px; padding-top: 38px; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); }
  .owned-head { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.55fr) minmax(250px, .65fr); gap: 24px; align-items: start; }
  .owned-head h2 { max-width: 820px; margin: 7px 0 10px; }
  .owned-head p { color: var(--muted); }
  .owned-head aside { padding: 16px; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 12px; background: var(--surface-muted); }
  .owned-head aside p { margin: 6px 0; font-size: .88rem; }
  .owned-head aside a { font-size: .84rem; font-weight: 700; }
  .owned-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 14px; margin-top: 22px; }
  .owned-card { padding: 20px; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 16px; background: var(--surface); }
  .owned-card.recommended { border-width: 2px; }
  .owned-card small { color: var(--muted); }
  .owned-card h3 { margin: 8px 0 6px; font-size: 1.05rem; }
  .owned-card p, .owned-card li { color: var(--muted); }
  .owned-card ol { padding-left: 1.2rem; }
  .owned-card li + li { margin-top: 6px; }
  .metric { font-size: 1.05rem; font-weight: 800; line-height: 1.5; }
  .price { margin-top: 3px; color: var(--muted); font-size: .84rem; }
  .claim { margin-top: 14px; padding-top: 12px; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); font-size: .86rem; font-weight: 700; }
  .billing { padding: 10px 12px; border-radius: 10px; background: var(--surface-muted); font-size: .83rem; }
  .decision-line { margin-top: 18px; padding: 17px 19px; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 13px; background: var(--surface-muted); }
  .decision-line p { margin: 6px 0 0; color: var(--muted); }
  .evidence-note { margin-top: 16px; color: var(--muted); font-size: .82rem; line-height: 1.65; }
  @media (max-width: 820px) {
    .owned-head, .owned-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  }
  @media (max-width: 520px) {
    .owned-card { padding: 16px; }
  }
</style>
